# PromptSploit .clineignore
# Single biggest context lever. Everything here is invisible to Cline.

# Web UI — 207,959 LOC. Out of scope permanently (stays TypeScript, D5).
src/app/

# Docs site — large, not code
site/
docs/

# Providers — 99,388 LOC across 109 integrations.
# Being deleted in favour of LiteLLM (D2). Never port these.
# Comment out ONLY if a task genuinely needs one provider as reference.
src/providers/

# Build artefacts and deps
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Lockfiles — huge, zero signal
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Examples — 100s of files, will derail exploration
examples/

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Notes:
# - test/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Tests are the specification (Phase 3).
# - Ignoring src/app and src/providers removes ~307k of 336k LOC from reach.
